---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Contact Us | Support & Custom Font Encodings"
	description="Contact the UnicodeToNonUnicode.com team for support, feature requests, bug reports, or to request custom font encodings."
	keywords="contact unicode to non unicode, custom font encoding request, indic font support"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-4 sm:py-8">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<div class="border-b border-[var(--hairline)] pb-6 space-y-3">
			<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--hairline)] text-[var(--ink-secondary)] font-semibold inline-block uppercase tracking-wider">
				Get In Touch
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)] text-balance">
				Contact Us & Support
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl text-pretty">
				Have questions, found a bug, or need support for a new legacy font format? We'd love to hear from you.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Content Area -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
			<!-- Contact Information (2 Cols) -->
			<div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6">
				
				<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs space-y-5">
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] border-b border-[var(--hairline)] pb-3 text-balance">
						How to Reach Us
					</h2>
					<p class="text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-pretty">
						We are always looking to improve our converter. For all inquiries, please email our support team directly. We typically respond within 24-48 hours.
					</p>
					
					<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-lg p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
						<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] p-3 rounded-full border border-[var(--hairline)]">
							<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[var(--ink)]" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--ink-secondary)] uppercase tracking-wide">Support Email</p>
							<a href="mailto:support@nonunicodeconverter.com" class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)] hover:opacity-80 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--ink)] rounded">
								support@nonunicodeconverter.com
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-5 space-y-4">
					<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)] tracking-tight">When should you email us?</h2>
					
					<ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
						<li>
							<strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">Output Errors:</strong> If a specific character or word is not converting correctly, please send us the original Unicode text and mention which font format you were trying to convert it to.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">New Font Functionality:</strong> Need a font format that isn't supported yet? Email us the name of the font.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">Custom Font Mappings:</strong> If your publication uses a custom ASCII font layout, <strong>please email us a sample text file or the font mapping matrix</strong>. Do not upload or send proprietary font files if it violates licensing—just send us the mapping rules or character matrix, and we will add support for it!
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">General Feedback:</strong> Any suggestions to make the tool better for your daily DTP workflow.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Sidebar -->
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
				<!-- Box 1: Quick Help -->
				<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
					<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] flex items-center gap-2 text-balance">
						<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--ink)]" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
						</svg>
						Need Quick Help?
					</h3>
					<p class="text-xs text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-pretty">
						Not sure how to use the converter? Check out our step-by-step guide on how to convert text and use it in Photoshop, InDesign, or MS Word.
					</p>
					<a href="/how-to-use" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full mt-2 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-md text-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--hairline-strong)] hover:bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] transition-colors">
						Read the How-to Guide &rarr;
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
